# Git Learning Lab — P13 hardening review.
#
# Cloudflare Pages reads this file natively (no build step needed) and
# applies these headers to matching responses. Deliberately minimal — a
# Content-Security-Policy was evaluated and NOT added here (see
# docs/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md's P13 report): this SPA relies on inline SVG icons
# built at render time (frontend/src/visualizer.js/terminal.js) and hash-based
# navigation, and a correct CSP for that would need real testing/iteration
# this hardening pass explicitly scoped out as future work, not a safe
# same-day addition. The three headers below carry no such risk — none of
# them change how the page loads, renders, or navigates.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
